        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued on Omar Al-Ghazali. Al-Ghazali has missed his payment deadline for a contract he put out on his consruction competitors. The  missed contract payment  is most likely due to the large amount of money spent for the construction of the very building we are staging his death. You are cleared to engage. Eliminate Al-Ghazali as cleanly as possible, avoiding collateral damage as far as possible. Im sure this will deter any future clients from missing any payments.",
